I'm right over you.


01:01:40.405 --> 01:01:41.497
Come on, man.


01:01:41.615 --> 01:01:43.663
What do you say?


01:01:44.492 --> 01:01:48.417
If all the cells work
together, what will happen'?


01:01:56.796 --> 01:01:58.639
The entire system is healed.


01:01:58.757 --> 01:02:00.430
Exactly.


