01:08:05.832 --> 01:08:07.049
Okay, we are done.


01:08:07.166 --> 01:08:08.509
It's perfect.


01:08:09.502 --> 01:08:11.220
You got to go after your dreams, Eric.


01:08:11.337 --> 01:08:13.214
