01:09:04.223 --> 01:09:05.270
It's from...


01:09:05.558 --> 01:09:07.560
No. It's French.


01:09:07.727 --> 01:09:09.070
No, the name is French.


01:09:09.228 --> 01:09:11.356
Coq au vin is of, obviously...
<i>Oui,</i> oui.


