It's all fowl...


01:09:17.153 --> 01:09:18.655
No, it's all...
It's a bird country.


01:09:18.780 --> 01:09:20.578
It's honestly...
Okay.


01:09:20.740 --> 01:09:22.333
Whatever restaurant
you ordered this from,


01:09:22.450 --> 01:09:25.249
