you thank the chef.


01:09:25.328 --> 01:09:26.375
And you just did.


01:09:26.454 --> 01:09:27.580
The chef, me.


01:09:27.664 --> 01:09:28.711
To the chef.


01:09:28.790 --> 01:09:29.837
To the chef.
To me.


01:09:29.916 --> 01:09:31.008
Whoever it is.


